Copyright (c) 2026 Cristiano

The protocol implemented here was reverse-engineered by the author of
https://github.com/japananimetime/controlvault3-linux-fingerprint, released under the MIT licence.
Their write-up (docs/secure-channel.md) and reference implementation documented the secure channel,
the frame layout and the command sequences; the constants in
crates/cv3-core/src/proto.rs derive from that work, and this project exists because it was
published.

That project's code is not vendored here. It is kept locally, outside version control, as the
reference this implementation is checked against.

No vendor code, firmware or key material from Broadcom, Dell or Canonical is included or
redistributed.
